---
// Approved prototype home markup, ported 1:1.
---
<!-- ================= HOME ================= -->
<div id="home">
  <div id="heroUI" class="fixed-ui">
    <div class="copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Harrison, Arkansas</p>
      <h1>We build software,<br>games and <em>clay 3D</em>.</h1>
      <p class="lede">A small studio with one workbench. Scroll in and everything on the screen is something we built.</p>
      <p class="scrollhint"><span class="mouse" aria-hidden="true"></span>Scroll to sit down at the workbench</p>
      <p id="termLive" class="sr" aria-live="polite"></p>
      <p class="idlehint" aria-hidden="true">▼ scroll, click the screen, or type <b>help</b></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="track" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <section id="bench" class="bench" aria-labelledby="benchT">
    <div class="bench-head">
      <div><p class="prompt">C:\BENCH&gt; dir /all</p><h2 id="benchT">Everything on the <em>bench</em></h2></div>
      <dl class="stats"><div><dt>CLAY PACKS</dt><dd>48</dd></div><div><dt>MODELS</dt><dd>730</dd></div><div><dt>TEXTURES</dt><dd>176</dd></div></dl>
    </div>
    <div class="grid" id="grid">
      <a class="pol far" style="--r:-3deg" data-depth=".5" href="https://rdwlabz.itch.io/dormant-red" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/projects_dormant-red-shot-1.webp" alt="Dormant Red gameplay" loading="lazy" style="filter:brightness(1.5) contrast(1.1)"><span class="k">GAME · BROWSER</span><span class="n">Dormant Red</span><span class="d">Restore a dead space station before your oxygen runs out. Free on itch.io.</span></a>
      <a class="pol far" style="--r:2deg" data-depth=".7" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.rdwlabz.puttdrop" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/projects_putt-drop-shot-1.webp" alt="Putt Drop on a phone" loading="lazy" style="object-position:50% 30%"><span class="k">GAME · ANDROID</span><span class="n">Putt Drop</span><span class="d">One-thumb mini golf for phones. Now on Google Play.</span></a>
      <a class="pol far" style="--r:-1.5deg" data-depth=".45" href="https://yottaify.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/showcase_yottaify_card-1280.webp" alt="Yottaify home page" loading="lazy"><span class="k">WEB</span><span class="n">Yottaify</span><span class="d">GPU cloud landing page.</span></a>
      <a class="pol far" style="--r:3deg" data-depth=".6" href="https://forgepizzaco.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/showcase_forge-pizza-co_card-1280.webp" alt="Forge Pizza Co home page" loading="lazy"><span class="k">WEB</span><span class="n">Forge Pizza Co</span><span class="d">Menu-first site for a Harrison pizza restaurant.</span></a>
      <a class="pol far" style="--r:-2deg" data-depth=".55" href="https://bingoauctions.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/showcase_bingo_card-1280.webp" alt="BinGo Auctions home page" loading="lazy"><span class="k">WEB · AUCTIONS</span><span class="n">BinGo Auctions</span><span class="d">Live online auctions for a liquidation warehouse in Harrison. Bid from your phone.</span></a>
      <a class="pol far" style="--r:2.5deg" data-depth=".65" href="https://bookbaytime.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/showcase_bookbaytime_card-1280.webp" alt="BookBayTime staff sign-in" loading="lazy" style="object-position:50% 45%"><span class="k">WEB APP</span><span class="n">BookBayTime</span><span class="d">A booking and staff app for service bays.</span></a>
      <a class="pol far" style="--r:-1deg" data-depth=".5" href="https://verrow.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/showcase_verrow_card-1280.webp" alt="Verrow AI home page" loading="lazy" style="filter:brightness(1.4)"><span class="k">WEB · PARTNER</span><span class="n">Verrow AI</span><span class="d">Our partner&rsquo;s site, built together. Home-video design.</span></a>
      <div class="pol far" style="--r:1.5deg" data-depth=".6"><img src="img/showcase_swarm-watch.webp" alt="Swarm Watch command center" loading="lazy"><span class="k">SYSTEM · INTERNAL</span><span class="n">Swarm Watch</span><span class="d">Command center for Project Swarm, built with Verrow AI.</span></div>
      <div class="pol far" style="--r:-2.5deg" data-depth=".7"><img src="img/ps5_farm_rack.webp" alt="A rack of PS5 consoles" loading="lazy"><span class="k">SYSTEM · LOCAL LLMS</span><span class="n">PS5 LLM farm</span><span class="d">Jailbroken PS5s running local LLMs as build workers.</span></div>
      <div class="pol" style="--r:1.5deg" data-depth="1.1"><img src="img/library_packs_vikings-and-dark-ages_thumb.webp" alt="Clay monk, bear and shield" loading="lazy"><span class="k">CLAY 3D · 24 MODELS</span><span class="n">Vikings and Dark Ages</span><span class="d">Monks, bears, shields and longships.</span></div>
      <div class="pol" style="--r:-2.5deg" data-depth="1.3"><img src="img/library_packs_prehistoric_thumb.webp" alt="Clay cave dwellers" loading="lazy"><span class="k">CLAY 3D · 24 MODELS</span><span class="n">Prehistoric</span><span class="d">Cave dwellers, tortoises and stone tools.</span></div>
      <div class="pol" style="--r:2.5deg" data-depth="1"><img src="img/library_packs_egypt-and-bronze-age_thumb.webp" alt="Clay Egyptian figures" loading="lazy"><span class="k">CLAY 3D · 24 MODELS</span><span class="n">Egypt and Bronze Age</span><span class="d">Pharaohs, jackals and bronze blades.</span></div>
      <div class="pol" style="--r:-1deg" data-depth="1.2"><img src="img/library_packs_modern-ii_thumb.webp" alt="Clay construction worker and cat" loading="lazy"><span class="k">CLAY 3D · 24 MODELS</span><span class="n">Modern II</span><span class="d">City life, sports and school.</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="bench-note">Private builds, name only: Forge Pizza Co menu and Cluer Pipeline.<br>Sites and software we built, some together with our partner <a href="https://verrow.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Verrow AI</a>. Clay packs spin in 3D in the library; downloads coming soon.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" aria-labelledby="dlgT">
    <div class="pin">
      <div id="dlgWrap">
        <div class="dlg">
          <div class="dlg-bar"><span>NEW_PROJECT.TXT</span><span aria-hidden="true">_ ▢ ×</span></div>
          <div class="dlg-body">
            <h2 id="dlgT">Bring us a <em>build.</em></h2>
            <p>Software, a website, a game or an asset pack. One email: what it is, links that show the vibe, rough timing.</p>
            <div class="dlg-btns"><a class="b98 primary" href="mailto:devops@therdw.com">[ OK ] Email the lab</a><a class="b98" href="#about">About us</a></div>
            <p class="addr">devops@therdw.com</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="foot">
    <div class="fl">
      <svg width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 240 210" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M60 200c-8-54 0-108 44-134 36 20 52 76 44 134z" fill="#EF8A5C" stroke="#3A3A36" stroke-width="8"/><circle cx="94" cy="110" r="9" fill="#3A3A36"/><circle cx="120" cy="110" r="9" fill="#3A3A36"/></svg>
      <div><b>RDW Labz</b><small>© 2026 RDW, LLC · 1301 N Main St, Harrison, AR 72601 · devops@therdw.com</small></div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Footer"><a href="/#work">[Work]</a><a href="/about">[About]</a><a href="mailto:devops@therdw.com">[Email]</a><a href="https://verrow.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">[Partner: Verrow AI ↗]</a></nav>
  </footer>
</div>
